WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.140
Music Festival

00:01.370 --> 00:06.090
Love... love... love... love!

00:06.090 --> 00:10.760
I sense someone diligent in love!

00:10.760 --> 00:14.730
Wonderful! Truly wonderful!

00:14.730 --> 00:16.150
But it's not enough!

00:16.150 --> 00:19.990
I need more! You must work 
harder at love... Love!

00:20.640 --> 00:23.500
You're very suspicious, aren't you?

00:23.500 --> 00:26.850
No. I am an apostle of love.

00:26.210 --> 00:28.960
Music Festival

00:27.300 --> 00:28.390
I am!

00:34.540 --> 00:36.030
I have an...

00:36.900 --> 00:39.950
...unpleasant feeling.

00:41.290 --> 00:46.290
Episode 10: Terror! Music Festival

00:42.570 --> 00:44.090
Yay!

00:45.440 --> 00:47.020
That was perfect, huh?

00:47.020 --> 00:51.430
Yeah, I'm glad the Seven 
Shadows were so into it.

00:51.430 --> 00:53.970
I was shocked how good their harmony was!

00:53.970 --> 00:55.530
Thank you!

00:55.530 --> 00:58.440
Well, everyone but Delta.

00:59.990 --> 01:02.730
Why am I the only one left out?

01:02.730 --> 01:05.610
Because you were flailing around
 trying to strike your cymbals.

01:05.610 --> 01:07.210
Yup, yup!

01:07.210 --> 01:09.630
I'm disappointed in you!

01:09.630 --> 01:12.650
I don't want to hear that from you, Lupisregina!

01:12.650 --> 01:14.380
Wanna fight?

01:15.980 --> 01:17.780
I'm so sorry.

01:18.200 --> 01:19.550
Hm?

01:20.930 --> 01:23.340
I don't see Alpha-sama.

01:23.340 --> 01:27.250
Class 3's choir performance is about to begin.

01:27.250 --> 01:33.520
Okay, guys, let's go to the audience 
seats and see how the others do!

01:33.520 --> 01:34.270
Yes.

01:39.530 --> 01:41.810
You can do it, Yunyun-kun!

01:41.810 --> 01:47.490
They'll be doing a performance 
of... "The Frog's Solo"?

01:47.490 --> 01:50.290
Huh? S-Solo?

01:50.290 --> 01:57.340
The little froggie...

01:57.970 --> 02:05.130
... but actually,

01:58.420 --> 02:00.840
I can't let anyone suspicious like you in.

02:00.840 --> 02:08.810
Why? I'm so diligent in love!

02:01.710 --> 02:03.100
Alpha.

02:05.130 --> 02:12.170
I just go "ribbit ribbit ribbit!"

02:05.130 --> 02:08.110
Class 2's performance is about to begin.

02:08.110 --> 02:08.810
CZ.

02:08.810 --> 02:11.740
That's right! Why am I not allowed in,
 when I'm the hunter of love?

02:11.740 --> 02:16.410
We in class 1 did all we could.

02:15.660 --> 02:20.140
That's right! I'm an apostle of love!

02:19.130 --> 02:23.160
But class 2 might be better.

02:20.140 --> 02:21.560
I see.

02:21.560 --> 02:23.660
The exit is that way.

02:23.400 --> 02:25.540
Simply because your master is amazing?

02:23.660 --> 02:25.520
I'm not leaving!

02:25.520 --> 02:28.410
I refuse to leave!

02:26.250 --> 02:29.710
That's part of it, but that's not all.

02:29.710 --> 02:31.290
That's not all?

02:32.310 --> 02:37.960
There may be things that can only 
be born in this world, maybe.

02:37.960 --> 02:41.270
Love! Love! Love! Love!

02:41.270 --> 02:44.890
So let's go see what they might be.

02:46.230 --> 02:47.090
Yes.

02:51.340 --> 02:55.370
Okay, I'm breaking in!

02:54.070 --> 02:56.420
They're annoying.

02:55.370 --> 02:57.220
Leave it to me.

02:56.810 --> 02:57.650
Yes.

02:57.260 --> 02:59.070
Not happening!

02:59.070 --> 03:03.370
And I go "ribbit ribbit ribbit!"

03:00.530 --> 03:04.370
Hey, is the Supreme Being a devil?

03:04.370 --> 03:07.170
Ains-sama is very kind.

03:04.740 --> 03:08.430
Thank you! Thank you, everyone!

03:07.170 --> 03:08.430
Brainwashing?

03:09.460 --> 03:16.460
I was so worried I'd mess up, 
but I'm so happy it worked out!

03:12.980 --> 03:19.180
I can't believe a music festival will determine
 whether we get to go home or not.

03:16.460 --> 03:18.350
Thank you all!

03:19.180 --> 03:21.090
It's nice and peaceful, right?

03:21.090 --> 03:25.010
You know what they say. 
It all ends with a song, right?

03:25.010 --> 03:26.570
That's a poetic expression.

03:26.570 --> 03:30.020
Sometimes Subaru seems shockingly educated.

03:30.020 --> 03:32.810
No, I think he picked it up 
from some manga or something.

03:32.810 --> 03:35.250
Are you guys still talking?

03:35.250 --> 03:37.010
They're about to cue us!

03:37.010 --> 03:38.330
Right, right.

03:38.330 --> 03:39.830
Don't treat me like that!

03:49.180 --> 03:52.950
Are you all ready?

03:52.950 --> 03:54.670
Yup!

03:54.670 --> 03:58.630
I'm expecting the best performance from you!

04:30.790 --> 04:33.470
How does the timing go?

04:33.470 --> 04:34.700
Here we go!

04:34.700 --> 04:37.590
Three, two, one!

04:41.710 --> 04:43.820
Stare...

04:53.730 --> 04:57.080
Emilia-neechan and the others 
are doing pretty well.

04:57.080 --> 04:58.650
Yeah.

05:08.710 --> 05:12.050
Hey, guys, doesn't the percussion sound weird?

05:12.660 --> 05:15.540
I keep hearing this 
weird squirming sound.

05:15.540 --> 05:17.230
I'm not doing anything.

05:17.230 --> 05:18.570
True.

05:18.570 --> 05:22.770
But if I'm hearing it, it means 
you're doing something bad!

05:23.700 --> 05:28.110
Ains-sama, please ignore the 
words of that useless goddess!

05:28.110 --> 05:31.990
Listen, I've given you plenty of chances,
 but that's going too far!

05:28.620 --> 05:31.990
Look, Ains-sama, that's your cue!

05:31.990 --> 05:33.630
Listen to me!

05:35.980 --> 05:39.980
I have a bad feeling.

05:41.230 --> 05:43.480
Is Otto doing okay?

05:43.790 --> 05:47.930
It seems we're surrounded by enemies.

05:47.930 --> 05:49.700
A-Are we?

05:50.090 --> 05:52.830
You guys took too long to notice.

05:55.980 --> 05:58.690
What? Who are these guys?

05:58.690 --> 06:00.810
Battle stations, everyone!

06:01.970 --> 06:03.920
Are these...

06:05.760 --> 06:07.590
the flowers we raised?

06:09.230 --> 06:11.150
The morning glories?

06:14.640 --> 06:16.340
Lightning!

06:16.340 --> 06:18.210
Huh? Huh?

06:19.100 --> 06:20.350
I can't draw my sword!

06:20.350 --> 06:21.910
What's going on?

06:22.580 --> 06:24.350
What is this?

06:24.350 --> 06:28.400
And why are they all still 
holding their instruments?

06:28.780 --> 06:32.450
So we can, of course, continue our performance.

06:33.780 --> 06:35.700
Bind!

06:42.170 --> 06:45.000
They don't look so tough.

06:45.370 --> 06:48.470
What... design... would be best?

06:52.740 --> 06:54.650
We have bigger problems.

06:59.270 --> 07:00.890
Al Shamak!

07:02.940 --> 07:05.020
Black Hole!

07:08.150 --> 07:09.950
Ains-san, now!

07:10.410 --> 07:11.260
Go!

07:21.260 --> 07:26.820
Wow, they fended off the enemy 
while doing their performance.

07:26.820 --> 07:29.170
Weren't they all amazing, Master?

07:29.170 --> 07:29.910
Yup.

07:30.260 --> 07:33.890
But why can't we use our spells?

07:33.890 --> 07:35.350
Or our weapons.

07:36.540 --> 07:37.970
What's going on?

07:37.970 --> 07:41.040
Another rule of this world?

07:41.040 --> 07:45.090
Indeed, man who smiles much more lately.

07:45.090 --> 07:46.540
Vanir-sensei.

07:46.900 --> 07:51.460
Class 1, and the lonely girl in class 3
 as well, are all in the audience.

07:51.900 --> 07:56.910
And the audience can't do anything 
that would ruin the music festival.

07:56.910 --> 07:59.970
But isn't class 2's performance done?

07:59.970 --> 08:00.710
Yes.

08:00.710 --> 08:03.390
Their "performance" is over.

08:04.170 --> 08:05.620
What does that mean?

08:05.620 --> 08:08.590
You understand well, Vanir-sensei.

08:09.090 --> 08:10.300
Albedo-san?

08:10.930 --> 08:13.460
The music festival isn't over?

08:13.460 --> 08:17.770
Because we've got more in store for you!

08:17.770 --> 08:20.680
Get in your places, everyone!

08:21.570 --> 08:27.020
Good. You understood the assignment.

08:27.020 --> 08:32.000
Of course. The order was to finish 
the music festival, right?

08:32.000 --> 08:34.230
Wait? With the enemy still out there?

08:34.230 --> 08:36.830
Yup, with them still out there!

08:36.830 --> 08:42.360
We must overcome them while completing our task.

08:42.360 --> 08:45.380
You guys have gotten too used to this world.

08:46.450 --> 08:47.790
What's going on?

08:48.290 --> 08:49.370
Alpha-san...

08:50.970 --> 08:54.380
Don't tell me they're going to 
sing in this situation, as well?

08:54.380 --> 08:56.600
Yup, that's right!

08:56.600 --> 09:00.640
Oh, I think there's one more 
problem we have to deal with.

09:01.590 --> 09:02.930
One more problem?

09:05.330 --> 09:08.940
What is that?!

09:14.360 --> 09:17.480
Something like a last boss showed up!

09:17.480 --> 09:18.910
Yes.

09:18.910 --> 09:21.520
This thing looks like real bad news!

09:21.520 --> 09:23.970
Yes. It does.

09:23.970 --> 09:25.870
But even so...

09:25.870 --> 09:28.730
That doesn't change our job.

09:28.730 --> 09:31.420
Yup, just like we planned.

09:34.060 --> 09:35.230
What?

09:37.030 --> 09:39.800
Like we planned?

09:43.410 --> 09:47.600
Really... You guys suck!

09:47.600 --> 09:49.090
Fine!

09:49.090 --> 09:52.320
Just like we planned, 
we finish the music festival!

09:52.320 --> 09:53.530
Fine, I said it!

09:53.530 --> 09:57.540
Let's do it, then! 
Cocytus, start playing the piano!

09:58.930 --> 10:00.150
What's wrong?

10:01.270 --> 10:04.020
The sheet music got torn.

10:04.020 --> 10:06.670
I can't play... the piano.

10:06.670 --> 10:10.270
No... After all the practicing we did?

10:12.190 --> 10:13.310
Cocytus!

10:13.310 --> 10:15.050
Shut up!

10:16.380 --> 10:19.540
Can anyone else play?

10:20.330 --> 10:23.780
I don't think anyone can play 
without sheet music.

10:24.230 --> 10:26.770
At this rate, the music festival is doomed!

10:32.060 --> 10:33.070
Shadow?!

10:33.860 --> 10:36.100
In a world where the light is dazzling,

10:36.450 --> 10:38.820
the shadow must be dazzling as well.

10:43.290 --> 10:44.660
I...

10:49.190 --> 10:50.580
Am...

10:51.610 --> 10:53.670
An die Freude.

10:55.010 --> 10:56.210
Atomic.

10:56.210 --> 10:57.750
Atomic...

11:19.150 --> 11:21.130
Now we can fight in the open air!

11:21.130 --> 11:23.030
Everyone, get ready!

11:28.160 --> 11:30.630
Welcome, uninvited guest.

11:30.630 --> 11:35.250
We hope you enjoy class 2's chorus...

11:35.250 --> 11:37.450
and combat!

12:51.330 --> 12:55.250
ISEKAI QUARTET 3
